    "html_content": "<article class=\"post-single-page post-single-large-image post-3894 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-nacci-blog\" id=\"post-3894\">\n<header class=\"wd-single-post-header\">\n<div class=\"wd-post-image\">\n</div>\n</header>\n<div class=\"wd-entry-content\">\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"/>\n<meta content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" name=\"viewport\"/>\n\n\n<noscript>\n\n</noscript>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n<!-- HERO IMAGE -->\n<div class=\"hero\">\n<picture decoding=\"async\">\n<source data-lazy-srcset=\"https://naccius.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/48-volt-solar-system.jpeg.webp\" type=\"image/webp\"/>\n<img alt=\"48 Volt Solar System — complete guide to panels, LiFePO4 battery storage and off-grid setup\" data-lazy-src=\"https://naccius.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/48-volt-solar-system.jpeg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%200%200'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 12px; margin: 20px 0; box-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\"/><noscript><img alt=\"48 Volt Solar System — complete guide to panels, LiFePO4 battery storage and off-grid setup\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/blog/48-volt-solar-system.jpeg\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 12px; margin: 20px 0; box-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\"/></noscript>\n</picture>\n<div class=\"hero-badge\">Free Download · PDF Guide</div>\n</div>\n<!-- INTRO -->\n<p class=\"intro\">\n    Planning a 48V solar system? Before you buy anything, get the numbers right.\n    This free PDF covers everything in one place — from <strong>how to size your panels and battery bank</strong>,\n    to wiring specs, component selection, and maintenance schedules.\n    Written for buyers and installers. No filler, no upsell — just the technical detail you need.\n  </p>\n<!-- DOWNLOAD BOX -->\n<div class=\"dl-box\">\n<div class=\"dl-head\">\n<div class=\"dl-icon\">📄</div>\n<div class=\"dl-title\">\n        48V Solar System — Complete Guide &amp; Specifications\n        <span>PDF · Free · April 2026</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"dl-body\">\n<div class=\"toc-title\">What’s inside</div>\n<ul class=\"toc-list\">\n<li>Why 48V outperforms 12V and 24V</li>\n<li>Solar panel specs and series wiring</li>\n<li>LiFePO4 battery specifications</li>\n<li>MPPT charge controller sizing</li>\n<li>Inverter selection guide</li>\n<li>System sizing calculator (step-by-step)</li>\n<li>Wiring gauge and fuse reference table</li>\n<li>Lifespan and maintenance schedule</li>\n<li>Off-grid vs hybrid vs grid-tied comparison</li>\n<li>6 expert FAQ answered</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"toc-note\">\n        Covers systems from <strong>1 kW to 10 kW</strong> with storage from <strong>5 kWh to 30 kWh</strong> —\n        suitable for tiny houses, off-grid homes, telecom backup, and small commercial sites.\n      </p>\n<a class=\"dl-btn\" href=\"https://naccius.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/48V-Solar-System-Guide-NACCI.pdf \">\n<span class=\"dl-btn-icon\">⬇</span>\n        Download Free PDF Guide\n      </a>\n<span class=\"dl-meta\">PDF · 8 pages · No email required</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- PRODUCT LINK -->\n<a class=\"product-strip\" href=\"https://naccius.com/product/storage-cube-48v-series/\" target=\"_blank\">\n<div class=\"ps-icon\">🔋</div>\n<div class=\"ps-text\">\n<div class=\"ps-label\">NACCI Product</div>\n<div class=\"ps-name\">Solar Home Li-Ion Battery Energy Storage Cube — 48V Series</div>\n<div class=\"ps-desc\">Wall-mounted LiFePO4 storage designed for 48V solar systems. CE certified. ODM/OEM available.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ps-arrow\">→</div>\n</a>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n</div>\n</article>"
