    "meta_desc": "Top 10 EV Battery News Stories for April 2026: Geely sets a new record with 900V fast charging in just 5 minutes; Tesla partners with Sunwoda; BYD and CATL unveil the latest advancements in solid-state battery technology; sodium-ion battery technology achieves a major breakthrough; plus much more.",
    "category": "Battery Technology & Industry",
